{"success": true, "credits_remaining": 2746, "credits_charged": 1, "data": {"xdt_shortcode_media": {"__typename": "XDTGraphImage", "__isXDTGraphMediaInterface": "XDTGraphImage", "id": "3986811027027242291", "shortcode": "DdT_4GMka0z", "thumbnail_src": "https://scontent-lga3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/811501542_18625782688001809_7199077841983571257_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=Mzk4NjgxMTAyNzAyNzI0MjI5MQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkZFRUQueHBpZHMuMTQ0MC5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=Zod9K1cjgycQ7kNvwHbCRnz&_nc_oc=Adpp1JPrZcsmH7T2mDMe-JZ5O3PcnfjxzrPTq_Rbe_hufSFCPt1X_PuXpfs9QlO2ZmY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=hJp1zuJpS1OUEyFzFNAi5w&_nc_ss=78689&oh=00_AQOIb434RUb1WD_deDqhSLfUyEFG5Rov5J4VNzf7RfSR9A&oe=6AC4E3B2", "display_url": "https://scontent-lga3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/811501542_18625782688001809_7199077841983571257_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=Mzk4NjgxMTAyNzAyNzI0MjI5MQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkZFRUQueHBpZHMuMTQ0MC5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=Zod9K1cjgycQ7kNvwHbCRnz&_nc_oc=Adpp1JPrZcsmH7T2mDMe-JZ5O3PcnfjxzrPTq_Rbe_hufSFCPt1X_PuXpfs9QlO2ZmY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=hJp1zuJpS1OUEyFzFNAi5w&_nc_ss=78689&oh=00_AQOIb434RUb1WD_deDqhSLfUyEFG5Rov5J4VNzf7RfSR9A&oe=6AC4E3B2", "video_url": null, "has_audio": false, "product_type": null, "video_duration": null, "is_video": false, "owner": {"id": "549313808", "username": "nasawebb", "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-lga3-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/432029380_939863124412845_4074172309041694202_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=1&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=903dQnazjDkQ7kNvwF8DYyz&_nc_oc=AdoYGIJ4buBZNqkIpAUeVN5cdYxG_hR7Q4uAfDw9BX7VKhE6ujPfDabvTBf450w7zQ4&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ss=78689&oh=00_AQPROtJ2E5jfVXUSV0WRybT99JXwy6-4wA-yRzpVFMr32w&oe=6AC4F920", "full_name": "NASA Webb Telescope"}, "edge_media_to_caption": {"edges": [{"node": {"id": "3986811027027242291", "text": "In a class of their own\n\nHidden within this star-forming nebula (captured by our Webb telescope in one of its largest images to date) are strange objects called brown dwarfs. Generally less massive than stars and more massive than planets, they are neither. They form the same way stars do, but they never quite \"ignite.\" Just how small are the smallest objects created by the star-formation process?\n \nThe brown dwarfs here are about twice the mass of Jupiter - the least massive brown dwarfs found to date. For comparison, brown dwarfs are typically around 13 to 80 times Jupiter’s mass. These are so small, their existence poses challenges to the theories of star formation.\n\nAdding to their strangeness, one of these showed signs of a disk, suggesting small planets could form around an object that itself is only the mass of a planet.\n\nRead more at the link in @NASAWebb’s bio. See comments for image description. \n\nImage credit: NASA, ESA, CSA, Kevin Luhman (PSU), Catarina Alves de Oliveira (ESA), Mahdi Zamani (ESA/Webb)", "created_at": "1789484938"}}]}, "created_at": "2026-09-15T15:08:58.000Z", "taken_at_timestamp": 1789484938, "edge_media_preview_like": {"count": 343028, "edges": []}, "like_and_view_counts_disabled": false, "comment_count": 850, "edge_media_preview_comment": {"count": 850, "edges": [{"node": {"id": "18110935721157895", "text": "So beautiful 🥺", "owner": {"id": "9870093989", "username": "ayaaleaf", "is_verified": false, "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-lga3-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/778048646_18224278360333990_7900362722977294107_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy42MzUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=bhS7xeK2HY4Q7kNvwGS_IKW&_nc_oc=AdpneA6Jn8xxRZhmjssUv6L7aPeGRXnGw9V-JXdI5Hrihjm_gfYS6wWJE