724389389", "username": "mr.rooktalk", "is_verified": false, "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-lga3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/485018371_1312786149772989_4874675735236986472_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=rUTzeHuczcMQ7kNvwGEMfM6&_nc_oc=AdoJwdzPM5VwdXMq_b6NLoYuf-OnwIIjGCHhcvj_VqRyBIpzqJ-FIZhUA0Cqkr4igas&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ss=78689&oh=00_AQNzHPKA_GwgzH7_uxohyAMFalA1e7ATHNTu6YVXKXjUhA&oe=6AC5009F", "full_name": ""}, "edge_liked_by": {"count": 0}, "created_at": 1790811728}}, {"node": {"id": "18073188869495885", "text": "الله😍🌌", "owner": {"id": "35732332028", "username": "moha.mmad83cr7", "is_verified": false, "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-lga3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/794467553_18094962332188029_1187268521952584092_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=mlDbkyyRxtUQ7kNvwE5a-Cv&_nc_oc=AdoQ-x9UN8v-_TrBMmyvTTfpV4jsqYg3M_mtV1TsqsuFhecmmQY4abacmbXEVWxRJ14&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=hJp1zuJpS1OUEyFzFNAi5w&_nc_ss=78689&oh=00_AQNBLU2oxzYsPrc_t51rWq7qIY592UzAHiMeVFGj5sdxVQ&oe=6AC4FF24", "full_name": ""}, "edge_liked_by": {"count": 0}, "created_at": 1790807139}}, {"node": {"id": "17921272866221246", "text": "The scale comparison with Jupiter makes the boundary between a planet and a brown dwarf feel much less abstract. I’m fascinated that Webb can trace objects this faint inside a crowded star-forming cloud, where dust and distance usually hide the smallest members.", "owner": {"id": "72724389389", "username": "mr.rooktalk", "is_verified": false, "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-lga3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/485018371_1312786149772989_4874675735236986472_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=rUTzeHuczcMQ7kNvwGEMfM6&_nc_oc=AdoJwdzPM5VwdXMq_b6NLoYuf-OnwIIjGCHhcvj_VqRyBIpzqJ-FIZhUA0Cqkr4igas&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ss=78689&oh=00_AQNzHPKA_GwgzH7_uxohyAMFalA1e7ATHNTu6YVXKXjUhA&oe=6AC5009F", "full_name": ""}, "edge_liked_by": {"count": 0}, "created_at": 1790802949}}, {"node": {"id": "18166695007472160", "text": "Brown dwarfs are such a fascinating middle ground—massive enough to shape their neighborhoods, yet not quite able to ignite like stars. Seeing them embedded in a star-forming nebula makes that boundary feel wonderfully real.", "owner": {"id": "72724389389", "username": "mr.rooktalk", "is_verified": false, "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-lga3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/485018371_1312786149772989_4874675735236986472_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=rUTzeHuczcMQ7kNvwGEMfM6&_nc_oc=AdoJwdzPM5VwdXMq_b6NLoYuf-OnwIIjGCHhcvj_VqRyBIpzqJ-FIZhUA0Cqkr4igas&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ss=78689&oh=00_AQNzHPKA_GwgzH7_uxohyAMFalA1e7ATHNTu6YVXKXjUhA&oe=6AC5009F", "full_name": ""}, "edge_liked_by": {"count": 0}, "created_at": 1790773605}}, {"node": {"id": "18108079787187378", "text": "", "owner": {"id": "64933349020", "username": "davidlleatherman", "is_verified": false, "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-lga3-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.89012-19/573323465_1219825463302212_7278921664109726296_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=KsOoGv21mmoQ7kNvwEKo87R&_nc_oc=AdpXj102ye-6_tAcO1iMQKeTkdsu3bmnOnBYEm6inpJ9ijGipVGO1UgugpBgT7b-xSM&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=hJp1zuJpS1OUEyFzFNAi5w&_nc_ss=78689&oh=00_AQMwLcEZ-c7AR86seH2-kvj75p5xQVwlyP6qMV2nES7f_g&oe=6AC4F1A2", "full_name": ""}, "edge_liked_by": {"count": 0}, "created_at": 1790735091}}, {"node": {"id": "17970853758154952", "text": "Brown dwarfs are the awkward middle ground: too light for sustained hydrogen fusion, yet massive enough to shape their surroundings; finding them inside a star-forming nebula helps test how the boundary between planet and star is made.", "owner": {"id": "72724389389", "username": "mr.rooktalk", "is_verified": false, "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-lga3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/485018371_1312786149772989_4874675735236986472_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=rUTzeHuczcMQ7kNvwGEMfM6&_nc_oc=AdoJwdzPM5VwdXMq_b6NLoYuf-OnwIIjGCHhcvj_VqRyBIpzqJ-FIZhUA0Cqkr4igas&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ss=78689&oh=00_AQNzHPKA_GwgzH7_uxohyAMFalA1e7ATHNTu6YVXKXjUhA&oe=6AC5009F", "full_name": ""}, "edge_liked_by": {"count": 0}, "created_at": 1790730283}}, {"node": {"id": "18118748900294606", "text": "I know the way to escape suffering and break free from the cycle of reincarnation: it is by caring for animals—specifically birds and fish—and guiding them toward the Western Pure Land. This involves practices such as keeping birds and fish (for instance, by building a temple with a fish pond and installing loudspeakers to play the continuous chanting of the Buddha's name day and night for the fish to hear) and applying the Pure Land method. One should raise birds capable of human speech and help them chant \"Namo Amitabha Buddha\" ceaselessly, day and night, so that they may attain rebirth in the Western Pure Land and, in turn, help guide us there as well. Please spread this message so that everyone may escape suffering and break free from the cycle of reincarnation.", "owner": {"id": "69479664934", "username": "hpha.mnguyen", "is_verified": false, "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-lga3-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.89012-19/573323465_1219825463302212_7278921664109726296_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX